<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Nov trade deficit CZK 16.6bln, Jan-Nov 140.1.</title>
<headline>Czech Nov trade deficit CZK 16.6bln, Jan-Nov 140.1.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech trade deficit rose to 16.6 billion crowns in November from 15.9 billion in October bringing the January to November deficit to 140.1 billion crowns, the Czech Statistical Office said on Friday.</p>
</text>
